{"version":1,"content":"<p>儘管美國出口管制清單已將英偉達B300人工智能晶片列入對華禁運範圍，但最新調查顯示，只要認識「對的人」並且資金充足，這套Blackwell Ultra頂級硬件在中國並不難買到。據《華盛頓郵報》報道，一套搭載8顆GPU的B300伺服器在中國市場的報價約為300萬至340萬美元，相當於美國零售價的5到6倍。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588138.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.866297+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"4e5f6db0c2c7b88a89cb0024e7e9539f0bd9876815d756b15b3e799572c7b14a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}